      "content": "i just want peace. like, actual peace. not just a nap or a day off, but just for the noise in my head and this constant pressure to exist to finally stop. it feels like the only way to actually find stillness is to just... stop being. does that even make sense? like, isnt it sometimes more merciful to just let something go when it's clearly broken?",
